    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strange Days</strong> brings the retro charm of <strong>Game Boy</strong> <strong>Color</strong> to <strong>Steam</strong> in a bizarre, comedy-thriller adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714040/extras/5216c9d6bd13015e15d2450dc0904b82.poster.avif?t=1753874083\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714040/extras/5216c9d6bd13015e15d2450dc0904b82.apng?t=1753874083\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The package</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > When <strong>Niko</strong> and <strong>Blaze</strong> are tasked with delivering a mysterious package to a strange man in an abandoned factory, they uncover much more than they bargained for\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714040/extras/6b6aa2f00e5c927ba787562ee2c22430.poster.avif?t=1753874083\" width=480 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714040/extras/6b6aa2f00e5c927ba787562ee2c22430.webm?t=1753874083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714040/extras/6b6aa2f00e5c927ba787562ee2c22430.mp4?t=1753874083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UFO sightings in Triton</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumors of <strong>UFOs</strong> have everyone in Triton talking. <strong>Detective Misterio</strong> and <strong>Aura</strong> head into the nearby forest to separate fact from fiction. Are the aliens real\u2026 or just a town legend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714040/extras/727f7e187a32ec829237954bdf5a784d.poster.avif?t=1753874083\" width=480 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714040/extras/727f7e187a32ec829237954bdf5a784d.webm?t=1753874083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714040/extras/727f7e187a32ec829237954bdf5a784d.mp4?t=1753874083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World's end</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As you explore retro pixel art environments with nostalgic chiptune music, interrogate witnesses and solve clever puzzles, each clue draws you closer to a terrifying truth\u2014before it\u2019s too late!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714040/extras/79ab85d7b8f2f412804d281e84fce07e.poster.avif?t=1753874083\" width=480 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714040/extras/79ab85d7b8f2f412804d281e84fce07e.webm?t=1753874083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714040/extras/79ab85d7b8f2f412804d281e84fce07e.mp4?t=1753874083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play as <strong>different characters</strong> with unique perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Retro-inspired pixel art</strong> and <strong>chiptune soundtrack</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Puzzle-solving, exploration</strong>, and <strong>light detective mechanics</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Side <strong>mini-games</strong> integrated into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
